WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.920
Welcome to Sprint One.

2
00:00:02.840 --> 00:00:06.730
This is where our work begins:
finding a problem worth

3
00:00:06.745 --> 00:00:10.762
solving. In this sprint, you'll start
with situations you know from real

4
00:00:10.777 --> 00:00:14.711
work. Look for the gap between
what happens now and what

5
00:00:14.726 --> 00:00:17.460
people need, and the cost
of leaving it as it is.

6
00:00:17.820 --> 00:00:21.860
Your Problem Frame will make that
situation clearer: what happens,

7
00:00:22.280 --> 00:00:25.020
who feels it, and what you
still need to understand.

8
00:00:25.880 --> 00:00:27.680
Your own observations come first.

9
00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:30.760
AI can help you question your thinking later.

10
00:00:31.220 --> 00:00:35.312
By the end, you'll have a problem
you can investigate and a starting

11
00:00:35.327 --> 00:00:37.440
point for the rest of the course.

12
00:00:38.220 --> 00:00:38.900
Let's begin.
